  "text": "## Step 1: Closure Request Reception  \n### Customer-Initiated Closure  \n**Request Channels:**\n- **Branch:** In-person request to manager\n- **Phone:** Call customer service (0800-555-2265)\n- **Online:** Submit closure form in account portal\n- **Mail:** Written request to head office  \n**Information Required:**\n- Account number\n- Full name (matching account)\n- Address (for verification)\n- Reason for closure (optional, for feedback)\n- Preferred method of final payment (check, bank transfer, cash)  \n**Immediate Actions:**\n1. Record request (date, time, method, customer contact info)\n2. Verify customer identity (security questions or document verification)\n3. Confirm no holds on account (freezes, disputes, fraud investigation)\n4. Explain closure implications (no further transactions, interest stops, records archived)",
